GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "597A92B3FD68DC0F"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aMissionEvents + {
    GC_Event "{6DAD283C8A2F5106}" {
     m_sName "QRF (event 3, 1500s)"
     m_Advanced GC_EventOptions "{6C47450B2BCC5845}" {
      m_fDelay 1500
     }
     m_aActions {
      GC_MessageAction "{E1961D63EBD38E71}" {
       m_sTitle "FIA REINFORCEMENTS SPOTTED"
       m_sMessage "Infantry contact approaching from the west and south, approximately 1km away and moving fast."
      }
     }
    }
   }
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{19702E95D7D229E8}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Summary"
     m_sContent "A hasty Canadian assault to dislodge FIA forces from a barnyard and secure the surrounding area."
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{C6B628F0F14629F8}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2> "\
     "DTL: 08/12/2023, 1335hrs, Parallel, Zarichne, Ruha. "\
     "Weather: Heavy rain, moderate fog, sightlines just over 1km+, no forecast of change."\
     ""\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
     "Canadian forces have been conducting operations throughout the area, clearing key positions and pushing FIA forces away from their lines of advance. Earlier in the fighting, the barnyard at Parallel was cleared and left as an uncontested position as Canadian forces continued their operations elsewhere."\
     ""\
     "With Canadian forces tied up in fighting across the surrounding area, an FIA platoon managed to manoeuvre into the area undetected and reoccupy the barnyard. From their newly established position, they have begun harassing Canadian forces operating along the flank and disrupting ongoing operations."\
     ""\
     "The FIA presence has quickly become a threat to the wider Canadian advance. A Canadian platoon has now been tasked with a hasty assault to dislodge the FIA and regain control of the barnyard before they can further disrupt operations in the area."\
     ""
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{408A403DF70E7184}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Enemy forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "Enemy forces consist of approximately a platoon of FIA light infantry occupying the barnyard at Parallel. The position was previously cleared by Canadian forces before being reoccupied by the FIA during ongoing fighting in the surrounding area."\
     ""\
     "If we take too long to dislodge the FIA from the area, we risk making contact with potentially additional FIA forces moving into the barnyard. We should move with haste and aggression."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• No armed or armoured vehicles have been spotted in the area."\
     "• The FIA have reoccupied a previous position. Expect the barnyard to contain established defensive positions and fortifications."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{D9DD7A3256176AD9}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Friendly forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "We are <b>1st platoon, C Company, 3rd Battalion, Princess Patricia's Canadian Light Infantry (3 PPCLI)</b>, consisting of 26 personnel. We are currently positioned approximately 200m north of the barnyard at Parallel, preparing to conduct our assault."\
     "Operating at Platoon- due to recent casualties. "\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• We have no vehicles or supporting troops available."\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "• No resupply or additional equipment is available."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{9CC840683A80ADF5}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT</h2>"\
     "Conduct a <b>HASTY ASSAULT</b> to <b>DISLODGE</b> the FIA forces occupying the barnyards by <b>SWEEPING & CLEARING</b> each barnyard and <b>DESTROYING</b> enough troops to cause a withdraw."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
     "An FIA platoon has manoeuvred into the barnyard at Parallel and reoccupied a position previously cleared by Canadian forces. From here, they have begun harassing Canadian forces in the flank."\
     ""\
     "We are to move quickly and assault the barnyard before the FIA can further establish themselves. <b>SWEEP & CLEAR</b> all hostile forces from the position to <b>SECURE</b> the barnyards, restoring control of the area and allowing friendly operations to continue uninterrupted."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{A07F45EB236EE2DB}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Comsig"
     m_sContent "<h2>CALLSIGNS</h2>"\
     "• HQ - 21HQ"\
     "• 1SEC - 21Alpha"\
     "• 2SEC - 21Bravo"\
     "• WEP - 21Charlie"\
     ""\
     "<h2>FREQ/CHAN</h2>"\
     "• Platoon net - 42hz"\
     ""\
     "<h2>PASSWORDS</h2>"\
     "All can be changed at CO's discretion."\
     "• <b>Challenge:</b> Dingus | <b>Password:</b> sasuage"\
     "• Running password: 78"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_CAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{6ADC8E6B0D31C92B}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "Mission notes"
     m_sContent "<h2>END CONDITIONS</h2>"\
     "<b>CAF Victory:</b>"\
     "• Sweep and secure both barnyards + destroy 40% of FIA to force a withdraw."\
     ""\
     "<b>FIA Victory:</b>"\
     "• Destroy 90% of CAF forces."\
     ""\
     "<h2>NOTES</h2>"\
     "• JIP TP: Deny"\
     ""\
     "Mission made by TheLocalPub. Please use the <b>#feedback</b> channel on Discord to report issues or submit suggestions."
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
